WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.840
We just got a new coffee maker and it makes the most delicious coffee ever.

00:08.840 --> 00:14.400
I know how hard mornings can be when you do not have a good coffee to start.

00:14.400 --> 00:21.240
I researched different models for weeks before deciding which one to buy for our kitchen.

00:21.240 --> 00:25.740
Now our morning routine is so much more enjoyable, and we save money too.

